    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2NgkpvL6P9XtFFSx2Taex8j)_\n\nAdds `sp-modeline-parts-clock-rename`: edits the heading of the clocked-in entry (keyword, priority and tags kept), updates `org-clock-heading` and refreshes the mode line at once.\n\nOn the clock segment: mouse-1 still goes to the entry, mouse-3 now renames it, and the agenda moved from mouse-3 to mouse-2. Doc and tangled `.el` changed together.\n\nNot run in Emacs (none in the container).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCURBMs8KN6rM5ZjJG)_",
